src/libuvgs_astrobee/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Carolus / uVGS-2 -- 4-LED beacon detection and Perspective-4-Point pose
estimation. Original author: zauberflote1. Declared Apache-2.0 in
package.xml.

Modified in this repository:
  - camera intrinsics and beacon geometry moved out of the source into a
    configuration profile
  - Ceres solver convergence diagnostics surfaced to the caller
    (previously computed and discarded)
  - the detection/solver core split out into a ROS-free library
    (src/libuvgs_astrobee/src/{beacon_detector,ceresP4P,pose_est,
    pose_filter}.cpp), with the ROS node linking against it
  - blob-to-model correspondence changed from three single guesses to an
    exhaustive search over all 24 assignments, keeping the lowest-cost one
  - a cheirality constraint added to that search: a candidate placing the
    beacon behind the camera is rejected

The last two are algorithmic changes to the P4P solve, not merely structural.
An earlier version of this file stated there were none; that was true when
written and stopped being true on 2026-09-03 and 2026-09-04 respectively.

